{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56695","headline":"十二月三台词（新） 一 · 无名氏","name":"十二月三台词（新） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正月年首初春，[□□]（郭沫若补「万户」二字）改故迎新。\n李玄（郭改「理弦」，非是）附灵（郭改「抚琴」，非是）求学，树[下]（夏）乃[逢子]（二字原模糊，从龙晦、任半塘说写定）珍（郭沫若补以上三字爲「调银筝」）。\n项托七岁知事（郭沫若定爲「书」字），其罗十二[相]（〖想〗从郭沫若说改）。\n[若]（从郭说增）无良妻解梦，冯唐宁得忠[臣]（（辰）从郭说改）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}